From 307a0b2846b0d879c852a94f66db5ceec2cf96a5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mitch Johnston <mitch.johnston25@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 22:03:57 +1030
Subject: [PATCH] qt: Juxtopposed menu styling

Styles every Qt menu (main menu, player and library context menus) like the redesign's menu cards: a #191919 background with 48px rows, muted text, dim separators, disabled items in dark gray and a gray chevron for submenus. The style sheet is set on each menu as it is polished so other widgets keep the platform style, and on Windows the rounded corners and border come from DWM so the native shadow is kept.
